Viera Energy Balance

Food illustrations in public/assets are generated specifically for this project.
The Viera app icons in that folder accompany the project.
Third-party technique videos are linked or embedded from their original YouTube
publishers and are not redistributed here. The repository license does not cover
the linked videos, the linked maps, or the external nutrition reference sites.

public/vendor contains the Firebase JavaScript SDK 13.4.0 from the Google
Firebase CDN. Its source is distributed under Apache-2.0, with the separately
licensed protobuf component described in the upstream license. The vendor files
retain their license headers. The app module import paths in the AI Logic and
App Check bundles were made relative to support offline loading.

